OL,3,AHarry says he 'slipped into depression'
OL,4,Aduring royal exit
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Duke of Sussex has said he "slipped
OL,7,Finto depression for about two weeks"
OL,8,Fafter relocating to Canada in 2019
OL,9,Fahead of his move to the US.
OL,11,FPrince Harry, who with his wife Meghan
OL,12,Fand their two children recently
OL,13,Freturned to the UK, said he had
OL,14,Foriginally left the country to "get
OL,15,Fsome space" while opening up about his
OL,16,Fmental health.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,0,100
