OL,3,AHarry says he 'slipped into depression'
OL,4,Aduring royal exit
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe duke also discussed a prolonged
OL,7,Fperiod of feeling "emotionally numb"
OL,8,Ffollowing the death of his mother
OL,9,FDiana, Princess of Wales, because he
OL,10,Ffelt "disloyal and guilty for the
OL,11,Fpossibility of being happy and joyful
OL,12,Fwithout her".
OL,14,FHe and his brother, the Prince of
OL,15,FWales, have previously been candid
OL,16,Fabout their mental health struggles,
OL,17,Fincluding over their mother's death,
OL,18,Fand both are involved in mental health
OL,19,Fcharities.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
